{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "7b4930ea5dac89b4885f71c2a60a07973b8e9b81e6bb07443160d963ee2d114d", "ja": "なかよしの『せーふく』！", "zh": "相亲相爱的『征服』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "38655554b0bd3d4324a20a62a5dcbdcddc0e4f36297330e5ca7dc800d799a9c9", "ja": "『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』にゲスト出演\nすることになった雪歩。番組内で子ども達に\n奇妙な受け答えを繰り返すが、ひなたの回答\nを聞いて変化が。満足げな様子のまま、雪歩\nは光に包まれ消えてしまう。", "zh": "雪步成为《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》的\n特别来宾，在节目中对于孩子们所提的问题，\n她不断给出奇妙的答案，但是在听到日向的\n回答后，她的身上发生了变化。\n雪步被光芒包围，一脸满足地消失了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "06b2da7421626236ce1f54426469564618dd638449a5e0d6dd17786f56da562f", "ja": "（ロケ地に到着した。今日はこの山を子ども達と一緒に\n散策して『せーふく』する予定なのだが……）", "zh": "（抵达外景地了。今天预定要和孩子们\n一起在这座山上散步并进行『征服』，但……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2fd84e5c2bcaebbaeddb0bfae3db6af4c3f56cc52695de2aa21fa32e2ad91e7a", "ja": "ふふふ……♪\nミリオン星人の征服、楽しみです。", "zh": "呵呵呵……♪\n真期待百万星人的征服啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "12703628eec0925416becae43c23a693c1a4634e07f10bdce144e3563a7900ea", "ja": "あの……、無理を言ってすみません。\nしかも見学だけじゃなく、ゲスト出演まで……。", "zh": "那个……真抱歉我们这么强人所难。\n不只让她观摩，还让她当特别来宾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1003_bangumid", "source_sha256": "27f18bcad46c9d781dc2b182e52aad4d1e0b4f5ea7d80a3a154ea74e45d9dae7", "ja": "いえいえ、むしろ大歓迎ですよ！\n雪歩ちゃんが出てくれるなら、話題にもなりますから！", "zh": "不会不会，我们反而很欢迎的！\n雪步要是来上节目，也会引起热烈讨论啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1004_bangumid", "source_sha256": "fbbbd868b026ff23e88996b0f36316b7fbadabb5c1bdcd42a0b71de2f3af330a", "ja": "それじゃ、本番もよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "那就这样，正式拍摄时也要麻烦你们了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "679efc6e5a1c0f0928cc89616d64c026fba270495aba0f2fa55a5894f9d6d47d", "ja": "（うーん、事態がどんどん予想外な方向に……。\n今日の撮影、なんだか不安になってきたぞ）", "zh": "（唔……事情越来越往意料之外的方向发展了……\n我开始担心起今天的摄影了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "3831c295cd95d757e55381e08501d48d87b6696328d9ed96e98ccc8cf09bc1b3", "ja": "みんな、集まって～！　いつも通り、\n本番の前におねえさんたちとお話しようね！", "zh": "大家过来集合～！跟平常一样，\n正式拍摄前，先和姊姊我们说说话吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "ddd2af4b351cb6619e92bf338cf73bb3881c4b54ff3ccfdefa1ea9050d036196", "ja": "今日は、雪歩お姉さんも、いっしょ……だよ♪", "zh": "今天，雪步姊姊，也会一起来参加……喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1008_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "954451360e4bb30c377e18bd58db880905548a2b36066a9a9bcd2bdfdce6e5a7", "ja": "ねえねえ、雪歩おねーちゃんも宇宙人なの？", "zh": "欸欸，雪步姊姊也是外星人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1009_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "1efe10d4a0a4ea595ebba45d81c640dcbc38758232becf3f044e5b6cb661c4c4", "ja": "でも、宇宙船には4人で乗ってたんじゃないの？", "zh": "可是太空船不是只有搭四个人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "2552be85a06abf62ba79f72830c1aa1a734d9f20884e5c5fe5c5b324ed03d270", "ja": "（う……しまった。\n設定に関しては全然打ち合わせてなかった！）", "zh": "（呜……糟糕了。\n我们完全没有事先套好设定！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ab3e26867ae93c830c4cc36fb8836f15ec502d3163bf37908acae58ffcfad30a", "ja": "ふふふ……♪\nお姉さんは、別の宇宙船で来たんだよ。", "zh": "呵呵呵……♪\n姊姊我啊，是搭别的太空船来的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "58a71c9eca9b6e7d1df9f5fdaa61526aad4ae04b02def5f278c6ba050d6d7ec2", "ja": "（おお、雪歩のアドリブが冴えている……！\n不安だったけど、少し様子を見てみるか）", "zh": "（哦哦，雪步即兴发挥得真好……！\n虽然我本来不太放心，但还是再观望一下吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "7b1e6439d10db1b94e32ec343eada8600826040d34515fad259220b838a25dd3", "ja": "それじゃあ、みんなが『せーふく』できたもの、\nおねーさんたちに教えてくれるかな？", "zh": "那么大家可以告诉姊姊们，\n你们『征服』了哪些东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1014_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "353636ad129108fd4b065bd67003a2e5ca23cc74ce73f580dce553a62d03b4c0", "ja": "はいはい！\nぼく、おトイレせーふくしたよー！", "zh": "选我选我！\n我『征服』了上厕所喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1015_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "05e1460258cc0d3a8a836aba20014c11b968137330ad2d4e068f526ab5e38778", "ja": "はみがきもせーふくしたー！", "zh": "我也征服了刷牙～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1016_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "925549d1f582a4df5ccbe20009c19760e6617ac303b91c6d0ffd83f3870d4db5", "ja": "わたし、にんじんせーふくした！", "zh": "我征服了红萝卜～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "b592e36bebe2aeea95eb34d032c40be309df619e1060ab660ec4b5d5b6e02c67", "ja": "そうかいそうかい。\nみんな、とってもえらいねぇ。", "zh": "这样啊这样啊。\n大家都很了不起呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "5b2324f2cc3d70cf0af917f9f9875dde68cc3668503460df98ff047421db46df", "ja": "よ～し！\nこの調子で、どんどん『せーふく』していこー！", "zh": "很好～！\n就照这个样子，继续『征服』下去吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1019_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "89ba37019d8ca3907a62f532f3b8580bd1d07ec530437b4a970a2a434d9ee46f", "ja": "あれぇ、どうしたんだい？", "zh": "奇怪，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1022_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "c9a2e0ecc8a962ebc14769d4587f30bd33c7deeacb9a35714504a0f0535cfda4", "ja": "ぼく、いじわるなおにいちゃんをせーふくしたいけど、\nまだできなくて……。", "zh": "我本来想要征服爱欺负人的哥哥，\n但还没有成功……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "7ef25143fc249fa6a3bd7850e9720b9475d947580f6e30e1a28459b233876959", "ja": "いじわるなおにいちゃんかぁ……どうしたら\nいいかな？　雪歩さんはどう思いますか？", "zh": "爱欺负人的哥哥是吗……该怎么办才好呢？\n雪步姊姊你怎么想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dddc5a35320d3f8bcc494b4d41d54191ea8d8de1c82e7c964856183277975598", "ja": "いじわるなお兄ちゃん……敵ってことだよね？", "zh": "爱欺负人的哥哥……就是敌人对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "29e0d91d5e38dbae9b35d97c7c1959de3bf963d712b5beafcecb9359910696f5", "ja": "それなら、お兄ちゃんの弱点を探し出して、\nそこを全力で攻撃すればいいと思うよ。", "zh": "既然如此，就只要找出哥哥的弱点，\n全力攻击那个部分就好了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1026_040tam", "source_sha256": "d693afcb6f734be55f5c6cd896cbdb842f6801c3acb4a75df296c525784be0d9", "ja": "ええっ！？　こうげきするの！？", "zh": "咦咦！？要攻击吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1027_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9e08ae96827679a213f889def035de83bb2807f98240f12f4ab766febc6dd4ed", "ja": "うん、弱いところに戦力を集中して、戦線を突破する。\nそれが星間戦争の基本だから。", "zh": "嗯，把战力集中在脆弱的部份，突破战线。\n这就是星际战争的基础。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "c847f66dffd5feb11c2d2543d8b3878aba9f903ad44cbca2604f9481fd721e27", "ja": "せーかんせんそー？", "zh": "星际战争？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "0dcb4add7a1f13d4025796a58380adfda81c75732e40b687159dd374b619af96", "ja": "えっと……\nゲームの、話……？", "zh": "呃……\n你是在说游戏吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1030_004yuk", "source_sha256": "12033f036a0bf32399861bf963f7636ffc10ee2096e6bca66d6be8a920bde504", "ja": "どんな星でも同じ。\n……弱い星は、生き残る事はできないの。", "zh": "不管在哪个星球上都一样。\n……弱小的星球，是无法存活下去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1031_kodomotati", "source_sha256": "d2dfdeef9aa65101c945a7eaef1f985447864866efffafd8c711d200a116a267", "ja": "（ざわざわざわ……）", "zh": "（一片哗然……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "bb3aa14b70f4219fd9ca6a69a5c3be1e4c9bd655858034f6742f5b419fc2bdc4", "ja": "（和やかだった空気がヘンな感じに……。\nや、やっぱりここは、止めに入るべきか……？）", "zh": "（原本和谐的气氛变调了……\n这、这种时候，应该要去插话打岔吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1033_035hin", "source_sha256": "e0fa3eebe6c8c435e69097bd5bae7fbacad5c5e4c7a38aa11724a6321761182e", "ja": "弱いところかぁ。そうだねぇ……。\nお兄ちゃんは、なにが苦手なんだい？", "zh": "脆弱的部份呀……我想想……\n你哥哥有什么不喜欢的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1034_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "8a587912a8e9ef5a50bf2d8b4fe609c9bbc8116b39a73c967160c3c8b2c366ae", "ja": "うーん……牛乳？", "zh": "唔……牛奶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1035_035hin", "source_sha256": "c54d84cd427a6ba6570d1749cb66291d93da90ba80b552d4e43e53db2c749149", "ja": "じゃあ、今度こっそり飲んであげようね。\nありがとうって、仲よくなれるかもしれないよぉ。", "zh": "那你下次就偷偷帮他喝吧。\n他可能会跟你道谢，然后你们就会相亲相爱啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1037_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "78563a1931bd04b4503367fa7b8732f417476415535c9c48462ec12a2d6cd6c9", "ja": "……わかった、やってみる！\nありがとー！", "zh": "……我知道了，我会试试看！\n谢谢你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1038_035hin", "source_sha256": "f31ea65144c85284d6bf3098da64614db383cb7e041847eac6a1a3b7c3f97ca5", "ja": "うん、せーふくがんばってねえ。", "zh": "嗯，要努力征服喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1039_004yuk", "source_sha256": "4cb07b16c01849aff48eb6d3b9a548e9b6c258883b8cef05307d2d99cf19b781", "ja": "仲良くなって、せーふく……。", "zh": "用相亲相爱来征服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1040_035hin", "source_sha256": "59a573caefe00af65dc28037b2a6068d84fb4c91e0a366e3433463fa69d52e2a", "ja": "そうだよぉ。あたしにも弟がいるんだけども、\nいうこと聞いてくれないこと、いっぱいあったんだわ。", "zh": "对啊～因为我也有弟弟，\n他常常不听我的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1041_035hin", "source_sha256": "98881676bd81accc50140181a2e4e1f53fdc1fe2eb9ee2f186b42519225d39f3", "ja": "でも、遊んであげたり、親切にしてあげたら、あとで\nちゃんということ聞いてくれたんだぁ。", "zh": "但是只要跟他一起玩，好好对待他，\n他之后就都会乖乖听我的话喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1042_022ser", "source_sha256": "5ed925748c0c38e8d09dc5198a6eea6e7ecce755cb56e8af491f3d9960cb0334", "ja": "ジュニオールも一緒です。\n仲良くなるほど、いうことを聞いてくれるんですよ！", "zh": "朱尼奥尔也是一样。\n只要跟牠感情越好，牠就会越听话喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1043_024ann", "source_sha256": "095bfded84ccf6eaead054b9ad35f97fd997396e9b94470d8c4b1148f664983a", "ja": "今の、杏奈たちも……\nそう……だよね？", "zh": "杏奈我们现在……\n也是……一样的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1044_040tam", "source_sha256": "4060a9c8a60f3ce748db787d0a013b3710830ed5077777de3f2226a1e3260610", "ja": "うん！　たまきたち、みんなと仲良くなって、\nせーふくするんだ～。だから合言葉は～！", "zh": "嗯！环我们要和大家当好朋友，\n然后征服大家～所以口号就是～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1045_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1046_035hin", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1047_022ser", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1048_024ann", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1049_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ea422ee6f4b933a17b471a79deba99209736b465902c99f65921c45701025022", "ja": "『せーふく』……。", "zh": "『征服』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1050_035hin", "source_sha256": "1bc1761b20f65a871e43b35d8448c6babc7b026931e1827bafb2bf047fbd68f0", "ja": "ありゃ？　雪歩さん、どうしたんだい？\nなんだか、ぼーっとしてるようだけど……。", "zh": "奇怪？雪步，你怎么啦？\n你怎么好像在发呆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1051_004yuk", "source_sha256": "780827709ec7f4807ddffba0b9a51bba6865219d9760223b626762a690396196", "ja": "そう……征服の形は、ひとつじゃない。\n仲良くなって……。痛みを『せーふく』して……。", "zh": "没错……征服的方式并不只有一种。\n好好相处……『征服』疼痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1052_024ann", "source_sha256": "e68133839c2c754fcad8406a927ee03b3827b40018c235f168674d1e26965191", "ja": "雪歩さん……？", "zh": "雪步……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1053_004yuk", "source_sha256": "bbddfe710dca46c3b83e115e8fb9ebd573bdd3d4f241807de8e5aa07d1094bad", "ja": "……私、見学に来てよかった。", "zh": "……我来这里观摩，果然是正确的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1054_004yuk", "source_sha256": "09c92fdd5e7ae4f6ab7974257a0385de491e129b30300c21c8847789d54022fa", "ja": "間に合うか、わからないけど……でも、もう一度だけ。\n『せーふく』出来るか、頑張ってみるね。", "zh": "虽然不知道还来不来得及……但是我要再试一次。\n我会努力去『征服』看看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1055_004yuk", "source_sha256": "633e3510d2a644a15bfad109da70201581e60fbc7d3ce8ba3b1fbe1fbc3647e6", "ja": "ありがとう、小さな子たち……。\nこの星を、たくさん『せーふく』してあげてね。", "zh": "谢谢你们，各位小朋友……\n你们要在这个星球上『征服』很多东西喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1056_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fcbb161c9e1d78964d33b5965b6c7fdcaa52a8bb67bf80d77c050ac1fd3fed58", "ja": "あなたたちの……ぬくもりで……。", "zh": "用你们的……温暖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1057_p", "source_sha256": "174904dfe917bbcba8458aec62adb3570e03cee7966b6cb7a04cfd387aecbacf", "ja": "（うわっ！　なんだ、この光は！？）", "zh": "（哇！这道光是怎么一回事！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1058_022ser", "source_sha256": "b19526fd8706064fccdde6cee18848b4994c00cf93720cf4a5482e1b62d2e245", "ja": "い、いまのは一体……えっ？", "zh": "刚、刚才那到底是……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1059_040tam", "source_sha256": "e92955463abc050c6a783b3fa46a4ea2bea63b2e45d5b5e08185aedc537450c3", "ja": "あれ？　雪歩お姉ちゃん、どこいったの！？", "zh": "奇怪？雪步姊姊去哪里了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1060_p", "source_sha256": "750dd21131ed4069954c40e7b8a1c6c2f3624a468ed5ad279eaf698c9805a2be", "ja": "雪歩が……消えたのか！？\nいや、そんなハズは……！", "zh": "雪步她……消失了吗！？\n不，这怎么可能……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1061_se", "source_sha256": "14c468c82099cb5a701b0e8229c722719a6ca26f0e37f00f015878f3d89eae31", "ja": "ガサガサッ", "zh": "（沙沙作响）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1062_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f8ba37647fc7b3e13d1899ed411f8945c68b58298838a5340385930f65686cf2", "ja": "ああっ、{$P$}！\nううう、よかったです～！！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n呜呜呜，真是太好了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1063_p", "source_sha256": "a04f1e2393ecd8dc1c9cb96d43e9365b834cbd6b6f6dc8c35793a0733b0a6be4", "ja": "雪歩！　よかった、消えてなかったんだな。", "zh": "雪步！太好了，你没有消失啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1065_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0a2c92696f7b98449d9749950f5c15fd8af66cf5038a67f8e63dd572beaeb528", "ja": "えっ？　あの……なに言ってるんですか？\n今日は私、オフでしたから……。", "zh": "咦？那个……你在说什么啊？\n我是因为今天休假……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1066_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8d0a2f6dccf17186443067f42f967eaa92e2458f960c4ef4bcf92dca21a36207", "ja": "陽気に誘われて、思いきってハイキングに来たら……\nなぜかいつの間にか、眠っちゃったみたいで……。", "zh": "才会看天气很好，就决定来健行……\n但不知道为什么，我好像不知不觉间睡着了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1067_004yuk", "source_sha256": "99da5a663759412e83860b187e2ca68fd50bf489b7591320309097df83ef3c7b", "ja": "目が覚めたら、自分の場所もわからなくて、道に迷っ\nちゃって！　うう、本当にもうダメかと思いましたぁ！", "zh": "醒来的时候，我连自己在哪里都搞不清楚，\n完全迷路了！呜呜，我还以为我真的要不行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1068_p", "source_sha256": "15ed67767acf9ac68571f75d17a1b940ab5d2e1c222ab065ddf1db136ae50c23", "ja": "いやでも、さっきまで一緒に……。", "zh": "但是你直到刚才都一直跟我们在一起啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1069_040tam", "source_sha256": "e11113149160a29ee129d5be930aab05a685b43939a878360e87df4a42167027", "ja": "雪歩お姉ちゃん、今のぴかーって消える技、\nすごかったぞ！　ねえねえ、あれってどうやるの！？", "zh": "雪步姊姊，你刚才那个发光完就消失的招式\n好厉害喔！欸欸，那是怎么做到的啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1070_004yuk", "source_sha256": "191d546e45fd376d33423a557b2da8ea0f95cb741e53a2ad72ead17315eee580", "ja": "き、消える技……？\n環ちゃん、それって一体……？", "zh": "消、消失的招式……？\n小环，你在说什么啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1071_junior", "source_sha256": "65986794f4ada8d547f61aea073af00c6fddff56e0c02744f83a92a8af38d55b", "ja": "クゥン……", "zh": "汪呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1072_004yuk", "source_sha256": "44cd2af78db7ebc7f25d91b4ad3d44f17dbd43b0e796f94456d79385ad5b8e26", "ja": "ひい！？　い、犬です～！！", "zh": "咿！？有、有狗～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1073_se", "source_sha256": "1a6aca9d20942acd406d6b244e6be222b6ba774cf5f03cb8da11326273c54d24", "ja": "ガサガサガサッ！", "zh": "（沙沙作响）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1074_022ser", "source_sha256": "a34598cb36f1668773da562cdf0fd02089f1483f1e4523db01b6db0dd9c84688", "ja": "あっ、ごめんなさい雪歩さん！\nジュニオール、ちょっと茂みに隠れていようね。", "zh": "啊，对不起，雪步姊姊！\n朱尼奥尔，你先躲在草丛里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1075_p", "source_sha256": "050a61e1560c72c33f16989918cd2dafe81b7acd89da9c49bc7f1c7ffb98ad42", "ja": "おーい、待ってくれ雪歩ー！\nもうちょっと状況を整理させてほしいんだが……！", "zh": "喂～等等啊雪步～！\n让我把状况再弄清楚一点……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1076_004yuk", "source_sha256": "faa7257807999dcbde7fb6424383bc97962e44cb28aec5ef0eec49e9b5b2f6e3", "ja": "むっ、無理です無理です無理ですぅ～！\nうわーーーん！！", "zh": "没、没办法没办法没办法啦～！\n呜哇───！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1077_p", "source_sha256": "bce96eaf06be09b32752e0edcb0254b1446155144621a4ad630258459cf3931d", "ja": "（その後、どうにか雪歩をなだめ、収録は成功した。\nしかし、あの光の中に消えた雪歩はいったい……？）", "zh": "（那之后我们想办法安抚雪步，顺利完成了录影。\n不过那个消失在光芒中的雪步到底是……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0078_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0078_story_05_1078_p", "source_sha256": "e73ca0bdce0128df4ab0e189c422302414a39fb22c3554e8235ff377dd3f8981", "ja": "（雪歩が何か、勘違いしてるのか……。\nそれとも……？）", "zh": "（是雪步误会了什么吗……\n又或者是……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
